1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,686
This is the sign-in page.

2
00:00:01,806 --> 00:00:06,814
To begin, click Sign in with Google and
use your school Google account.

3
00:00:06,934 --> 00:00:10,715
Only your school account can enter the
library system.

4
00:00:10,835 --> 00:00:14,730
Once you sign in, the system takes you to
the next step.

5
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:16,767
Here you set up your account.

6
00:00:16,887 --> 00:00:24,654
Select Faculty, then type your 9-digit ID
number, for example 123456789, and choose

7
00:00:24,774 --> 00:00:30,367
Double check your details, then press
Continue to submit your account for

8
00:00:30,517 --> 00:00:33,815
After you submit, you will see this
waiting screen.

9
00:00:33,935 --> 00:00:38,037
It means your account was received and is
waiting for approval.

10
00:00:38,157 --> 00:00:40,785
You do not need to do anything else here.

11
00:00:40,905 --> 00:00:45,848
Just sign in again later, and once
approved you will land on your home page.

12
00:00:45,998 --> 00:00:47,437
This is the home page.

13
00:00:47,557 --> 00:00:53,106
It welcomes you and shows what is new in
the library, like recently added books.

14
00:00:53,226 --> 00:00:57,570
From the top menu you can move to the
catalog or sign in areas.

15
00:00:57,690 --> 00:01:02,217
Think of this as your starting point
whenever you open the system.

16
00:01:02,367 --> 00:01:05,354
This is the catalog, where you look for
books.

17
00:01:05,474 --> 00:01:10,691
Type a title, an author, or a keyword in
the search box and browse the results.

18
00:01:10,811 --> 00:01:13,731
You can filter and open any book to see
more.

19
00:01:13,851 --> 00:01:17,619
Use this page whenever you want to find
something to read.

20
00:01:17,769 --> 00:01:19,546
This is the book details page.

21
00:01:19,666 --> 00:01:24,478
Here you see the title, the author, and
whether a copy is available right now.

22
00:01:24,598 --> 00:01:30,105
From this page you can borrow the book to
take it home, or reserve it to hold your

23
00:01:30,225 --> 00:01:32,604
Just fill in the small form and confirm.

24
00:01:32,754 --> 00:01:34,932
This is your profile and overview.

25
00:01:35,052 --> 00:01:40,679
At the top you see your name, your ID
number, your department, and your phone

26
00:01:40,799 --> 00:01:47,981
Below that are your live counts: books you
currently have, overdue books, and

27
00:01:48,101 --> 00:01:50,145
Your borrowing limit is 5 books.

28
00:01:50,265 --> 00:01:55,621
You can also press Edit Profile to update
your name, phone number, or department.

29
00:01:55,741 --> 00:01:57,619
Your ID number stays the same.

30
00:01:57,769 --> 00:01:59,352
This is the request page.

31
00:01:59,472 --> 00:02:06,505
If the library does not have the book you
need, type the title and the author here

32
00:02:06,625 --> 00:02:11,585
Your sent requests appear below so you can
follow their status at any time.

33
00:02:11,735 --> 00:02:13,167
This is your history page.

34
00:02:13,287 --> 00:02:19,676
It keeps everything in one place: books
you borrowed before, your reservations,

35
00:02:19,796 --> 00:02:24,244
Come back here whenever you want to review
what you have done in the library.

36
00:02:24,394 --> 00:02:26,367
This is your notifications page.

37
00:02:26,487 --> 00:02:35,263
Here you receive friendly reminders, such
as when a book is almost due, when it is

38
00:02:35,383 --> 00:02:39,057
Check this page regularly so you never
miss a return date.

39
00:02:39,177 --> 00:02:42,755
Thank you for watching this tour of your
faculty account.

